⚡🇱🇾 Libyan security services have reported seizing about 100,000 ecstasy tablets that were pressed in the shape of Muammar Gaddafi's face and his distinctive robes.

The image of the former Libyan leader served as an unusual marking for a batch of drugs that was supposed to reach the country from Europe.

